# =============================================================================
# {{ project_name }} - Local Development Environment
# =============================================================================
# Prism generated this file with safe local defaults. Docker Compose reads it for the local PostgreSQL
# database. Edit it locally as needed. `copier update` will not overwrite it.
# There are no secrets here: no JWT secret and no identity provider settings. The `local` Spring profile
# signs its own development tokens in memory, and a real identity provider is set through the
# `spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.jwt.issuer-uri` property (see the `security-auth` skill).

